{"id":"00b831f06a1e9a49","group":"73","path":"73/73-ex-maximal-not-maximum-witness.md","title":"极大独立集未必最大","display":"ex-maximal-not-maximum-witness — 极大独立集未必最大","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-ex-maximal-not-maximum-witness","aliases":["73-ex-maximal-not-maximum-witness"],"display":"ex-maximal-not-maximum-witness — 极大独立集未必最大","depends_on":["[[73-df-maximal-versus-maximum-independent]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§10.4.2, print p. 459; PDF p. 481; local terminology counterexample","source_status":"local-example-and-exhaustive-three-vertex-argument","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":10},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-ex-maximal-not-maximum-witness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-ex-maximal-not-maximum-witness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-maximal-not-maximum-witness — 极大独立集未必最大"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf2cc39a9b1c7b63\" href=\"?note=cf2cc39a9b1c7b63\" title=\"73-df-maximal-versus-maximum-independent\">73-df-maximal-versus-maximum-independent</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§10.4.2, print p. 459; PDF p. 481; local terminology counterexample"},{"key":"source_status","html":"local-example-and-exhaustive-three-vertex-argument"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=3\">\\(n=3\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E=\\{\\{0,1\\},\\{0,2\\}\\}\">\\(E=\\{\\{0,1\\},\\{0,2\\}\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MaximalInd}_{3,E}(\\{0\\})\\land\n\\neg\\operatorname{MaximumInd}_{3,E}(\\{0\\})\\land\n\\operatorname{MaximumInd}_{3,E}(\\{1,2\\})\\land\\alpha(3,E)=2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MaximalInd}_{3,E}(\\{0\\})\\land\n\\neg\\operatorname{MaximumInd}_{3,E}(\\{0\\})\\land\n\\operatorname{MaximumInd}_{3,E}(\\{1,2\\})\\land\\alpha(3,E)=2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>中心顶点构成不可再添加顶点的独立集，但两个叶子给出更大的独立集。此小例用于防止教材词语的非标准用法传播进形式定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-maximal-versus-maximum-independent","status":"resolved","id":"cf2cc39a9b1c7b63","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-maximal-versus-maximum-independent]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n=3","display":false},{"tex":"E=\\{\\{0,1\\},\\{0,2\\}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MaximalInd}_{3,E}(\\{0\\})\\land\n\\neg\\operatorname{MaximumInd}_{3,E}(\\{0\\})\\land\n\\operatorname{MaximumInd}_{3,E}(\\{1,2\\})\\land\\alpha(3,E)=2.","display":true}],"bytes":1141,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-284","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-ex-maximal-not-maximum-witness|极大独立集未必最大]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["cf2cc39a9b1c7b63"]}